OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1781327062
OL,3,CScientists hope head impact study
OL,4,C'could change how MMA fighters train'
OL,6,FScientists behind pioneering research
OL,7,Flooking at head impacts in mixed
OL,8,Fmartial arts say they hope that the
OL,9,Fstudy will help "change the landscape"
OL,10,Fof how fighters approach training.
OL,12,FExperts from the University of Essex
OL,13,Fhave teamed up with The Combat
OL,14,FInstitute gym in Colchester to
OL,15,Finvestigate the impact of head blows
OL,16,Fin sparring sessions - using so-called
OL,17,F'smart mouthguards' fitted with
OL,18,Fsensors to detect how many times a
OL,19,Ffighter has been hit, and how hard.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat SportCNat Radio FWeather
FL,314,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1781327062
OL,3,CScientists hope head impact study
OL,4,C'could change how MMA fighters train'
OL,6,FIt's hoped the project, which has cost
OL,7,F#48,000 and is being partly funded by
OL,8,Fthe Biotechnology and Biological
OL,9,FSciences Research Council, will allow
OL,10,Fathletes to better understand their
OL,11,Ftraining loads - potentially helping
OL,12,Fto protect them from repetitive
OL,13,Fconcussions.
OL,15,FThe research is being overseen by Dr
OL,16,FNasir Uddin, Lecturer in Physiology at
OL,17,Fthe University of Essex, who has spent
OL,18,Fsix months studying data from fighters
OL,19,Fbased at the The Combat Institute.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat SportCNat Radio FWeather
FL,314,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1781327062
OL,3,CScientists hope head impact study
OL,4,C'could change how MMA fighters train'
OL,6,F"If we have a metric for measuring
OL,7,Fimpact to the head, we can then
OL,8,Fpotentially train smarter around it
OL,9,Fwhich is: 'OK, I've taken X amount of
OL,10,Fshots today - I should probably go
OL,11,Fabout my second session, or the next
OL,12,Fone, slightly differently.' Or I might
OL,13,Fdecide to go heavy on this day knowing
OL,14,Fthat I didn't do so much the previous
OL,15,Fday," he told ITV News Anglia.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat SportCNat Radio FWeather
FL,314,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1781327062
OL,3,CScientists hope head impact study
OL,4,C'could change how MMA fighters train'
OL,6,F"One could argue that you could go by
OL,7,Ffeel but we have a quantifiable way of
OL,8,Fdoing that and also, you wear
OL,9,Fmouthguards anyway - so, as along as
OL,10,Fthey're not an inconvenience and they
OL,11,Fwork really well - that's just an
OL,12,Fadditional tool."
OL,14,FThe mouthguards, which retail at
OL,15,Faround the #200 mark, are equipped
OL,16,Fwith a chip that measures the force
OL,17,Fand acceleration in the head when
OL,18,Fthere is a collision.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
