FL,314,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1781327062
OL,3,CScientists hope head impact study
OL,4,C'could change how MMA fighters train'
OL,6,FThe technology is now commonplace in
OL,7,Felite rugby after hundreds of ex rugby
OL,8,Funion and rugby league players signed
OL,9,Fup to a landmark concussion lawsuit
OL,10,Fagainst the sport's authorities.
OL,12,FAmong those seeking damages is ex-
OL,13,FNorthampton Saints star Steve Thompson
OL,14,Fwho was diagnosed with early onset
OL,15,Fdementia at the age of 42 in 2020 - 17
OL,16,Fyears after he lifted the Rugby World
OL,17,FCup with England, a tournament he can
OL,18,Flonger remember.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat SportCNat Radio FWeather
FL,314,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1781327062
OL,3,CScientists hope head impact study
OL,4,C'could change how MMA fighters train'
OL,6,FMr Thompson believes his condition was
OL,7,Fcaused by repeated blows to the head
OL,8,Fin training over a number of years -
OL,9,Fthe kind of story those involved in
OL,10,Fcombat sports like MMA are desperate
OL,11,Fto avoid.
OL,13,F"With early onset dementia and
OL,14,FAlzheimer's, it's a very scary thing,"
OL,15,Fsaid Australian flyweight, Christian
OL,16,FYoung.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat SportCNat Radio FWeather
FL,314,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1781327062
OL,3,CScientists hope head impact study
OL,4,C'could change how MMA fighters train'
OL,6,F"I've seen it firsthand with members
OL,7,Fof my family and it's about preventing
OL,8,Fthat. I want to be able to play with
OL,9,Fmy kids one day, play with my
OL,10,Fgrandkids one day, even my great
OL,11,Fgrandkids if I get that far - I want
OL,12,Fto remember those things."
OL,14,FDr Uddin said that plans are now in
OL,15,Fplace to rollout the study to other
OL,16,Fgyms up and down the country.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G7/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat SportCNat Radio FWeather
FL,314,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31308
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1781327062
OL,3,CScientists hope head impact study
OL,4,C'could change how MMA fighters train'
OL,6,F"I'd love to say that this would be
OL,7,Fthe general chitchat among all gyms,
OL,8,Fwhere it's not about going hard all
OL,9,Fthe time, it's actually about a
OL,10,Fprecision type of training where we
OL,11,Fknow that this is the amount of shots
OL,12,Fthat you should probably take," he
OL,13,Fsaid.
OL,15,F"It's about quality shots over
OL,16,Fquantity, and therefore, we've almost
OL,17,Fchanged the landscape of how people
OL,18,Fapproach training in a sport that is
OL,19,Frife with contact."
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G8/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
